          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem sum_abs_coefI2_mul_le {U V M : ℝ} (hU : 1 ≤ U) (hV : 1 ≤ V) (hM : 0 ≤ M) {q : ℕ}\n    (hq : Odd q) :\n    ∑ a ∈ Icc 1 ⌊M⌋₊, (if Odd a ∧ q ∣ a then |coefI2 U V a| * a else 0) ≤\n      M ^ 2 * Real.log V / (4 * q) + 3 * c₄ / 4 * M * V +\n        3 / 2 * (U + 1) ^ 2 * V * Real.log q / 4 :=",
