  "note": "The last '≤' needs ∑_{p^α≤V, p|q}(log p)p^α ≤ V log q, which is false; Lean proves the bound with the last term multiplied by 3/2. Erratum: The last '<=' of (4.55) is false: sum_{p^a<=V, p odd, p|q} (log p) p^a can approach (3/2) V log q. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_4_55.py`)."
